  "details": "Description\n\nNoticed that behavior happening some months ago ingame, saw this happening today on website. Don’t know the cause of this issue, if someone attempt to connect in service or is traveling two maps, there is a chance they disappear from friendlists. That's an enormous issue, can't imagine how much confusion this bug caused.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nHave a friend in friendlist, come in vrchat, then ask the friend to connect to vrchat. After that, ask them to go in a map they never saw before. Check friendlist behavior ingame and on website.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1912-2cf53b8d24-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
